 "findings": [
  {
   "finding": "Deterministic methods were evaluated at several seed indices that produced BITWISE identical outcomes.",
   "detail": "Affected: ['M5']. Each contributes 240 independent scenario outcomes, not\n720. The archived 5,280-rollout figure is a ROLLOUT count and must not be\nread as a sample size. Path B runs these methods once per scenario."
  },
  {
   "finding": "M1 training coverage and M1 evaluation coverage are different numbers.",
   "detail": "Stage 5 trained constant-context seeds [0, 1, 2]; Stage 6 evaluated only seeds [0].\nThe archived M2-M1 comparison therefore rests on a SINGLE M1 checkpoint against three\nM2 checkpoints, so it carries no M1 training variability at all. Path B evaluates five\nseeds on both sides."
  },
